Hi Mohan,

I have a similar setup, but I don't use another ethernet card, just
aliases.  You have to compile the ability into the kernel (if you
compile your own) or it comes with the standard distributed kernels
from places like RedHat.

I type:

ifconfig eth0:1 10.1.1.4

after the modem has set up eth0, then I use ipchains for my other
machines to be able to use the modem.  Email me privately if you
want my config files.

