> i heard from other people there's also a problem with newer cards since
> they use x86 code in their bioses


All cards use x86 code in their BIOSes but the DEC just emulates it so
there's no problem. The problem is cards that use 32 bit x86 code which the
DEC's little onboard emulator can't deal with. According to an email I got
from a nice guy a few days ago nVidia TNT is one card that uses 32 bit code
in the BIOS.

