Wrong guess. This message occurs after loading the root floppy into
ramdisk. It means that the device file /dev/console could not be
opened. And that is because the root floppy didn't contain a valid
root filesystem. For installing, you must prepare two floppies; one
containing the kernel for your system, and a second containing the
root filesystem. The root floppy must be inserted when requested.
If you did all that, it can also be that you gave the wrong command
to load the root filesystem, so that it was not loaded at all.

