box.  Make sure the /path/to/script.cgi has executable rights, for everyone
that you want.  If it still does not work then add an extra line to the
crontab.


       SHELL=/bin/sh
       MAILTO=<you>
       # run thirteen minutes after 23 'o clock.. every day
       13 23 * * *       /path/to/script.cgi
        * * * * *    echo "Test of crontab, you should get this in your
