You cannot...=20
I'll  assume the system did not come from MFG with only the Adaptec, =
since it was removed from the SOC early on  (A few 433's ") as a primary =
controller. The reason is the same problem you have. All our MFG tools =
to factory load the software are SRM based, and there were problems =
getting the rights to use Adaptec code in the SRM console. so... Adaptec =
was only available as an add on.  Check your box and see if the Qlogic =
1040B is still in there? (The few that did go through, had a Qlogic =
installed to load the software, then removed before final test.... real =
messy)

Else stick with AlphaBios

JJ
