(yeah!).=20

  Now if I don't support NT anymore what frigging use do I have for ARC =
?  None, so let's go for SRM and get rid of all that MILO stuff anyway.=20

  The install used MILO but that is accessory.=20

  Now here is the fun part.  Linux is installed on the scsi drives. Good =
!=20

  The PW500 was shipped by (then) DEC with NT installed so with ARC all =
