> 
> > y=floor(x); is equivalent to y=(double)(int)((x<0)?x-1:x);
> 
> OK, thanks for that it seems to work without hanging since
> it doesn't use the troublesome instruction. Worst case I can patch
> the libc source and recompile everything (yuck). This is especially
> annoying since I found that the X11 server contains the same bad
